<task id="admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source" xml:lang="zh-CN" audience="administrator devops" product="bpm-0-9-1" platform="linux"><title>在 Manjaro 稳定分支上从源代码安装 BPM</title><shortdesc>完整更新稳定分支并检查 Python 3.14 后安装 BPM。</shortdesc><taskbody><prereq><p>使用不早于 2026-06-26 更新的稳定分支，并具备 sudo、HTTPS 和已批准的引用。</p></prereq><context><p>Manjaro 为滚动更新；必须记录分支和完整更新状态。</p></context><steps>
<step><cmd>更新系统并安装必备软件。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source.dita#admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source/distro-prep"/></info></step><step><cmd>检出 BPM。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source.dita#admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source/checkout"/></info></step><step><cmd>安装并迁移 BPM。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source.dita#admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source/install"/></info></step><step><cmd>构建文档。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source.dita#admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source/docs"/></info></step><step><cmd>启动 BPM。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source.dita#admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source/start"/></info></step><step><cmd>检查结果。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source.dita#admin-task-install-manjaro-stable-source/verify"/></info></step><step><cmd>安全停止。</cmd><info><p>保留分支、包和日志信息；不要部分降级包或数据库。</p></info></step>
</steps><result><p>BPM 和文档已就绪，探针正常响应。</p></result><postreq><p>记录稳定分支日期并完成验证。</p></postreq></taskbody><related-links><link keyref="topic.admin-task-prepare-linux-source-deployment"/><link keyref="topic.admin-task-verify-linux-source-deployment"/></related-links></task>
